# Generated, not source. `site/` is rebuilt by the job-board workflow and
# uploaded straight to Pages; `backlog.md` is a local dump from backlog_dump.py.
# Both are derived from the live feeds, so committing them only publishes a
# stale copy of your job search into the repo history.
