# Resume tailoring. The repo is public, so anything holding personal data
# (phone, email, bullet phrasings, stored answers) stays local; the Action gets
# the bank through a secret. Generic files (aliases, taxonomy) are committed.
RESUME_TAILORING.md
*Resume.html
*Resume.tex
